Package: cprc
Title: Constrained Penalized Regression Combiners for Streaming Ensembles and Unsupervised Aggregation
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-11-22
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jongik", "Chung", email = "Jongik.Chung@ucf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Young Joo", "Yoon", role = "aut"),
    person("Cheolwoo", "Park", email = "parkcw2021@kaist.ac.kr", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements constrained penalized regression combiners (CPRC) on the
    unit probability simplex for adaptive model aggregation in non-stationary
    streaming environments and heterogeneous multi-subject studies. Supports
    generalized fused lasso and pairwise ridge penalties for supervised streaming
    regression and binary classification via an Alternating Direction Method of
    Multipliers (ADMM) and proximal gradient framework, along with angular concept
    drift diagnostics and homogeneous batch clustering. Also provides constrained
    ridge optimal scoring for unsupervised aggregation of high-dimensional
    statistical parametric maps, cumulative weight elbow diagnostics, and
    parametric bootstrap-based weighted t-tests with multiple-testing corrections.
